# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# City Sample-derived data - MUST NOT be redistributed
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Everything below is extracted from, or computed from, Epic's City Sample
# content. The Fab/Epic Content licence lets you use it in your own project; it
# does not let you republish it, and a road network or a navmesh derived from
# it is still derived from it. Anyone using this repository generates these
# files themselves from their own City Sample install - that is what the tools
# in tools/ are for, and it takes a few minutes.
#
# Deliberately listed one by one rather than by extension: a new derived
# artifact should have to be added here consciously.
zonegraph*.json
roadnetwork*.json
lights*.json
*.xodr
*.obj
*.bin
SmallCity.png

# Screenshots and renders of City Sample content
shots/
out/
*-rgb.png
*-seg.png
*.mp4
*.gif
# ...except the one showcase clip, which IS part of the repo.
!docs/citysample-carla.mp4
!docs/citysample-carla.gif

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local machine state
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
logs/
venv-carla/
snapshots/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.carla-python

# Unreal build output, in case a plugin is ever built in place
plugins/*/Binaries/
plugins/*/Intermediate/
CityRoadExport/Binaries/
CityRoadExport/Intermediate/
carlamayo-deferred/

# Machine-survey scratch, not part of the pipeline
tools/cpu_soak.py
tools/run-survey.ps1
